  "solution": {
    "text": "$x^2-3|x|+2=0 \\quad$ or $(|x|-2)(|x|-1)=0$\n$|x|=1,2$ or $x=\\pm 1, \\pm 2$ or $\\therefore$ No. of solution $=4$"
